  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. I am calling about a drain problem. Um, one moment, I have my notes. I live at 61 Pelham Street, in the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 61 Pelham. Got it. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a snowbank. It is blocking the catch basin, the drain in the street. And the water, it stays across the lane. It is not raining. There is no storm. It is just water, many days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the snowbank's sitting on the drain and the melt's pooling across the lane. Writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Also, there is a manhole cover near it. It looks, um, off by one inch. Not flat with the street. I am worried a car will hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, manhole cover sitting a little proud or low, about an inch. Let me pull up the, hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Okay, thank you for your help. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm still here, I was just in the system. Sorry about the quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I am sorry. I thought you were finished. I have one more question. Do you know when they last came by this street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Looks like I don't have a recent visit showing for that block. I'll send this to the crew supervisor, both the drain and the cover. Best number if they need you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thanks Josephine. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
